WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.809
Recovery restores trusted operations after containment and eradication have reduced the risk to an acceptable level.

2
00:00:06.959 --> 00:00:13.341
Recovery may include rebuilding systems, restoring from backups, re-enabling services, validating patches, checking data integrity,

3
00:00:13.491 --> 00:00:16.470
reviewing account state, and monitoring for recurrence.

4
00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:19.173
The phrase trusted operations is important.

5
00:00:19.323 --> 00:00:26.983
Recovery should not mean turning everything back on as quickly as possible and hoping the issue is gone.

6
00:00:27.133 --> 00:00:33.941
It means the organization has enough evidence that systems are safe to operate, controls are working,

7
00:00:34.091 --> 00:00:37.070
and business owners understand any residual risk.

8
00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:43.603
Recovery is usually coordinated, because technical readiness and business readiness are not always the same.

9
00:00:43.753 --> 00:00:52.264
A system owner may confirm that a server is rebuilt, while a business owner confirms that a process can resume.

10
00:00:52.414 --> 00:00:58.371
Monitoring should continue after recovery because some issues reappear only after normal traffic returns.

11
00:00:58.521 --> 00:01:05.755
Communication also matters: stakeholders need to know what is restored, what remains limited, what users should expect,

12
00:01:05.905 --> 00:01:08.884
and when the next update will come.

13
00:01:09.034 --> 00:01:15.843
Good recovery closes the immediate incident while keeping watch for signs that more work is needed.

14
00:01:15.993 --> 00:01:18.971
Recovery should include a deliberate observation period.

15
00:01:19.121 --> 00:01:25.930
After service is restored, responders should keep watching relevant logs, alerts, account behavior, and business signals.

16
00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:34.590
That follow-up monitoring helps confirm that eradication worked and gives stakeholders confidence that normal operations are returning for the right

17
00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:36.940
reasons.
